Package: FMCP
Type: Package
Title: Functional Linear Regression with MCP and SCAD Penalties
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Bahadir",
    family = "Yuzbasi",
    email = "bahadir.yuzbasi@inonu.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Fits smooth and locally sparse scalar-on-function linear
    regression models with functional minimax concave penalty (fMCP) and
    functional smoothly clipped absolute deviation (fSCAD) penalties. Dense
    functional predictors are represented with B-splines, while a roughness
    penalty controls smoothness and interval-wise functional penalties identify
    null subregions. Computationally intensive matrix construction, local
    quadratic approximation, tuning-grid fitting, and model scoring are
    implemented with 'RcppArmadillo'.
